# rustmusic-desktop
===
 Audiophile-grade desktop music player with native DSD (DSF/DFF) playback, multichannel SACD support, high-precision resampling, integrated DLNA server, synced lyrics, and OS media controls (Windows SMTC / macOS Now Playing / Linux MPRIS). Built with Tauri 2, SvelteKit, and Rust.
